+**Finding: a default-input lesson leaves a first-frame-only shortcut alive.**
+Audited generator SHA-256:
+`ebfbd4ce72a001e4d2472fc747df4e0cae503fa224e507f060bdbf4e2dcfe5c4`;
+selected rule hash `5c3cab649080`. A bounded search of seeds `0..7`, testing
